{
  "id": "daily-flow",
  "kind": "terminal",
  "language": "git",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Günlük akış",
    "en": "The daily flow"
  },
  "difficulty": 3,
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "setup": [
    {
      "remote": "https://github.com/ada/site.git",
      "files": {
        "index.html": "<h1>Home</h1>\n"
      },
      "message": "Add home page",
      "author": [
        "Ada Lovelace",
        "ada@example.com"
      ]
    },
    "git clone https://github.com/ada/site.git",
    {
      "remote": "https://github.com/ada/site.git",
      "files": {
        "index.html": "<h1>Home</h1>\n",
        "style.css": "body {}\n"
      },
      "message": "Add styles",
      "author": [
        "Grace Hopper",
        "grace@example.com"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "cwd": "site",
  "solution": [
    "git pull",
    "git switch -c add-faq",
    "echo \"<h1>FAQ</h1>\" > faq.html",
    "git add faq.html",
    "git commit -m \"Add FAQ page\"",
    "git push -u origin add-faq"
  ],
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Önce `git pull` (main'deyken), sonra dal, commit, `git push -u origin add-faq`.",
      "en": "First `git pull` (on main), then branch, commit, `git push -u origin add-faq`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı (komutları sırayla yaz):\n\n```bash\ngit pull\ngit switch -c add-faq\necho \"<h1>FAQ</h1>\" > faq.html\ngit add faq.html\ngit commit -m \"Add FAQ page\"\ngit push -u origin add-faq\n```",
      "en": "The full solution (type the commands in order):\n\n```bash\ngit pull\ngit switch -c add-faq\necho \"<h1>FAQ</h1>\" > faq.html\ngit add faq.html\ngit commit -m \"Add FAQ page\"\ngit push -u origin add-faq\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "git_state",
      "repo": "site",
      "tips": {
        "main": "^Add styles$"
      },
      "label": {
        "tr": "main güncel (Add styles)",
        "en": "main is up to date (Add styles)"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "git_state",
      "repo": "site",
      "tips": {
        "add-faq": "^Add FAQ page$"
      },
      "messages": [
        "Add FAQ page",
        "Add styles"
      ],
      "label": {
        "tr": "add-faq, güncel main'in üstünde",
        "en": "add-faq sits on the updated main"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "git_state",
      "repo": "site",
      "upstream": {
        "add-faq": "origin/add-faq"
      },
      "pushed": [
        "add-faq"
      ],
      "label": {
        "tr": "add-faq GitHub'da",
        "en": "add-faq is on GitHub"
      }
    }
  ]
}
